{"_kind": "doc", "slug": "nd272e303g00rexv", "title": "52.LangGraph工作流人机交互", "content": "<!doctype lake><meta name=\"doc-version\" content=\"1\" /><meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"fixed\" /><meta name=\"typography\" content=\"classic\" /><meta name=\"paragraphSpacing\" content=\"relax\" /><p data-lake-id=\"u4662415a\" id=\"u4662415a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf4500da3\" id=\"uf4500da3\">示例代码</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u0b0c1578\" id=\"u0b0c1578\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"file\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fwww.yuque.com%2Fattachments%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fppt%2F1387387%2F1745159945946-a1469a75-d759-4a72-8db8-0e703c601cf1.ppt%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22langgraph-hil.ppt%22%2C%22size%22%3A18810%2C%22ext%22%3A%22ppt%22%2C%22source%22%3A%22%22%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22download%22%3Atrue%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u63d9ee74-aeca-4826-b1f5-5af19a2f872%22%2C%22taskType%22%3A%22upload%22%2C%22type%22%3A%22application%2Fvnd.ms-powerpoint%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22uad5432bd%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u2a34d5f0\" id=\"u2a34d5f0\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u9eed3d13\" id=\"u9eed3d13\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: #DF2A3F\">注：将ppt后缀名改为zip后解压</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9d0f9788\" id=\"u9d0f9788\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5b6ccf17\" id=\"u5b6ccf17\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\">python版本：3.12.4</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"oII7y\" id=\"oII7y\"><span data-lake-id=\"u5c8d8aef\" id=\"u5c8d8aef\">Human-in-the-loop(人机交互)</span></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ub68f3c91\" id=\"ub68f3c91\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u44ed3f48\" id=\"u44ed3f48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">人机交互</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u16569367\" id=\"u16569367\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">（或称“在循环中”）工作流将人类输入整合到自动化过程中，在关键阶段允许决策、验证或修正。这在**基于 LLM 的应用**中尤其有用，因为基础模型可能会产生偶尔的不准确性。在合规、决策或内容生成等低误差容忍场景中，人类的参与通过允许审查、修正或覆盖模型输出来确保可靠性。</span></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"_2\" id=\"_2\"><span data-lake-id=\"u708a775a\" id=\"u708a775a\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">使用案例</span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#_2\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ubd1a3f8b\" id=\"ubd1a3f8b\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue94c8b77\" id=\"ue94c8b77\" style=\"color: var(--md-default-fg-color--lighter)\">​</span></a></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u687e97ef\" id=\"u687e97ef\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud8b31c92\" id=\"ud8b31c92\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">基于 LLM 应用中的</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc8bfcc58\" id=\"uc8bfcc58\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">人机交互</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc4cd6892\" id=\"uc4cd6892\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">工作流的关键使用案例包括：</span></p><ol list=\"u5ed3444a\"><li fid=\"u23bd011e\" data-lake-id=\"uc7d96444\" id=\"uc7d96444\"><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#review-tool-calls\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u1a647ccc\" id=\"u1a647ccc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u3c7fc8ed\" id=\"u3c7fc8ed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">🛠️</span><span data-lake-id=\"u939dbaaf\" id=\"u939dbaaf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\"> 审查工具调用</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u129b8126\" id=\"u129b8126\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">：人类可以在工具执行之前审查、编辑或批准 LLM 请求的工具调用。</span></li><li fid=\"u23bd011e\" data-lake-id=\"u32e54392\" id=\"u32e54392\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud465e76e\" id=\"ud465e76e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">✅</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ucec31f03\" id=\"ucec31f03\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> 验证 LLM 输出</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue34054af\" id=\"ue34054af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">：人类可以审查、编辑或批准 LLM 生成的内容。</span></li><li fid=\"u23bd011e\" data-lake-id=\"ucb9d6ff7\" id=\"ucb9d6ff7\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub8c6e110\" id=\"ub8c6e110\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">💡</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u88d95627\" id=\"u88d95627\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> 提供上下文</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u67822f04\" id=\"u67822f04\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">：使 LLM 能够明确请求人类输入以进行澄清或提供额外细节，或支持多轮对话。</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"interrupt\" id=\"interrupt\"><code data-lake-id=\"uc7225f1b\" id=\"uc7225f1b\"><span data-lake-id=\"uae913a8e\" id=\"uae913a8e\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt</span></code><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#interrupt\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"udc998484\" id=\"udc998484\"><span data-lake-id=\"udaab1125\" id=\"udaab1125\" style=\"color: var(--md-default-fg-color--lighter)\">​</span></a></h2><p data-lake-id=\"ucd462397\" id=\"ucd462397\"><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/reference/types/#langgraph.types.interrupt\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ua00ac21e\" id=\"ua00ac21e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u54057b7c\" id=\"u54057b7c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">interrupt函数</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5116b02c\" id=\"u5116b02c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u4a7b5bed\" id=\"u4a7b5bed\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在 LangGraph 中通过在特定节点暂停图形、向人类展示信息以及使用他们的输入恢复图形，从而启用人工干预工作流。该函数对于批准、编辑或收集额外输入等任务非常有用。</span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/reference/types/#langgraph.types.interrupt\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u211f8ec6\" id=\"u211f8ec6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u493ff375\" id=\"u493ff375\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">interrupt函数</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2bbd5d5d\" id=\"u2bbd5d5d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uf4c5b7a7\" id=\"uf4c5b7a7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">与</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7d781df5\" id=\"u7d781df5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/reference/types/#langgraph.types.Command\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u27916cbb\" id=\"u27916cbb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u04e4e7d5\" id=\"u04e4e7d5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">Command</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ucbcba0cc\" id=\"ucbcba0cc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u08cfd0bd\" id=\"u08cfd0bd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">对象结合使用，以人类提供的值恢复图形。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20langgraph.types%20import%20interrupt%5Cn%5Cndef%20human_node(state%3A%20State)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20value%20%3D%20interrupt(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BB%BB%E4%BD%95%E5%8F%AF%E5%BA%8F%E5%88%97%E5%8C%96%E4%B8%BA%20JSON%20%E7%9A%84%E5%80%BC%EF%BC%8C%E4%BE%9B%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E6%9F%A5%E7%9C%8B%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BE%8B%E5%A6%82%EF%BC%8C%E4%B8%80%E4%B8%AA%E9%97%AE%E9%A2%98%E3%80%81%E4%B8%80%E6%AE%B5%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC%E6%88%96%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E4%B8%80%E7%BB%84%E9%94%AE%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22text_to_revise%5C%22%3A%20state%5B%5C%22some_text%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%20%20%20%20%23%20%E4%BD%BF%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%9B%B4%E6%96%B0%E7%8A%B6%E6%80%81%E6%88%96%E6%A0%B9%E6%8D%AE%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E8%B0%83%E6%95%B4%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20return%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22some_text%5C%22%3A%20value%5Cn%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%5Cngraph%20%3D%20graph_builder.compile(%5Cn%20%20%20%20checkpointer%3Dcheckpointer%20%23%20%60interrupt%60%20%E5%B7%A5%E4%BD%9C%E6%89%80%E9%9C%80%5Cn)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%E7%9B%B4%E5%88%B0%E9%81%87%E5%88%B0%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%5Cnthread_config%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22configurable%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5C%22thread_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22some_id%5C%22%7D%7D%5Cngraph.invoke(some_input%2C%20config%3Dthread_config)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E7%94%A8%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%85%A5%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%5Cngraph.invoke(Command(resume%3Dvalue_from_human)%2C%20config%3Dthread_config)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22BCrpI%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%7B'some_text'%3A%20'%E7%BC%96%E8%BE%91%E5%90%8E%E7%9A%84%E6%96%87%E6%9C%AC'%7D%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lP2zR%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u3401d2aa\" id=\"u3401d2aa\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubcf6a6c1\" id=\"ubcf6a6c1\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">Warning</span></strong></p><p data-lake-id=\"u8739d68f\" id=\"u8739d68f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u03f0279c\" id=\"u03f0279c\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">中断非常强大且易于使用。然而，尽管它们在开发者体验上可能类似于 Python 的 input() 函数，但重要的是要注意，它们不会自动从中断点恢复执行。相反，它们会重新运行使用中断的整个节点。 因此，中断通常最好放置在节点的开头或一个专用的节点中。请阅读</span><span data-lake-id=\"u9c617b4b\" id=\"u9c617b4b\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#how-does-resuming-from-an-interrupt-work\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u00e5884f\" id=\"u00e5884f\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6a31e2de\" id=\"u6a31e2de\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">从中断恢复</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u3d7d13d1\" id=\"u3d7d13d1\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u29f08610\" id=\"u29f08610\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">部分以获取更多细节。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u1931c39d\" id=\"u1931c39d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7aa47810\" id=\"u7aa47810\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">完整代码</span></strong></p><h2 data-lake-id=\"_3\" id=\"_3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u31257ebf\" id=\"u31257ebf\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">要求</span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#_3\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u9a1e5093\" id=\"u9a1e5093\"><span data-lake-id=\"udf105e0e\" id=\"udf105e0e\" style=\"color: var(--md-default-fg-color--lighter)\">​</span></a></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u1c6ad0ec\" id=\"u1c6ad0ec\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9128ae00\" id=\"u9128ae00\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">要在图形中使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u81464dbe\" id=\"u81464dbe\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"uc02cc218\" id=\"uc02cc218\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5420f7a\" id=\"ue5420f7a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u58faa8d6\" id=\"u58faa8d6\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">，您需要：</span></p><ol list=\"u49ed50a7\"><li fid=\"uc2f6a6b0\" data-lake-id=\"u0ffac985\" id=\"u0ffac985\"><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/persistence/#checkpoints\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ud57de6f1\" id=\"ud57de6f1\"><span data-lake-id=\"u99aae833\" id=\"u99aae833\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">指定一个检查点</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5b59ce84\" id=\"u5b59ce84\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">，以在每一步后保存图形状态。</span></li><li fid=\"uc2f6a6b0\" data-lake-id=\"uc3c79435\" id=\"uc3c79435\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5717b22a\" id=\"u5717b22a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在适当位置调用</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u1a84a712\" id=\"u1a84a712\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u7732fd4b\" id=\"u7732fd4b\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue15b6c79\" id=\"ue15b6c79\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt()</span></strong></code><span data-lake-id=\"u5bb01761\" id=\"u5bb01761\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">。有关示例，请参见</span><span data-lake-id=\"uba50d424\" id=\"uba50d424\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#design-patterns\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u56b8e337\" id=\"u56b8e337\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf6807f3\" id=\"ucf6807f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">设计模式</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u5c017b54\" id=\"u5c017b54\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u7279b56f\" id=\"u7279b56f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">部分。</span></li><li fid=\"uc2f6a6b0\" data-lake-id=\"u89edb676\" id=\"u89edb676\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ubeef24af\" id=\"ubeef24af\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">使用</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9a5c8c70\" id=\"u9a5c8c70\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span></strong><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/persistence/#threads\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ue7b19a65\" id=\"ue7b19a65\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u40e54092\" id=\"u40e54092\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">线程 ID</span></strong></a><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u7b06ee29\" id=\"u7b06ee29\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ud7a90802\" id=\"ud7a90802\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">运行图形</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u23f72714\" id=\"u23f72714\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">，直到触发</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub97c48cd\" id=\"ub97c48cd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"ub0d168af\" id=\"ub0d168af\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1cf445b1\" id=\"u1cf445b1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uafb89ef0\" id=\"uafb89ef0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"uc2f6a6b0\" data-lake-id=\"u086e34b2\" id=\"u086e34b2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4662722c\" id=\"u4662722c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">使用</span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u49f1bce8\" id=\"u49f1bce8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u4db7e817\" id=\"u4db7e817\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf510bf6c\" id=\"uf510bf6c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">invoke</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u0e3f453e\" id=\"u0e3f453e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">/</span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u48cafd76\" id=\"u48cafd76\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u118b351e\" id=\"u118b351e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">ainvoke</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2f930938\" id=\"u2f930938\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">/</span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u0b1195f5\" id=\"u0b1195f5\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc6468e94\" id=\"uc6468e94\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">stream</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u2558170e\" id=\"u2558170e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">/</span></strong><code data-lake-id=\"u4adda1c8\" id=\"u4adda1c8\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u370811f2\" id=\"u370811f2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">astream</span></strong></code><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u69a41abf\" id=\"u69a41abf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span></strong><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udd5405f9\" id=\"udd5405f9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">恢复执行</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u24fba084\" id=\"u24fba084\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">（见</span><span data-lake-id=\"u1aa4311c\" id=\"u1aa4311c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#the-command-primitive\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u520ff5f9\" id=\"u520ff5f9\"><span data-lake-id=\"u97c1d81f\" id=\"u97c1d81f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">Command原语</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ubbbd4158\" id=\"ubbbd4158\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">）。</span></li></ol><h2 data-lake-id=\"_4\" id=\"_4\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9e413ef0\" id=\"u9e413ef0\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">设计模式</span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#_4\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u4cd9484a\" id=\"u4cd9484a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ube8c892e\" id=\"ube8c892e\" style=\"color: var(--md-default-fg-color--lighter)\">​</span></a></h2><p data-lake-id=\"u17b6c083\" id=\"u17b6c083\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue5e1748b\" id=\"ue5e1748b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">您通常可以采取三种不同的**行动**来实现人工干预工作流：</span></p><ol list=\"u96df3543\"><li fid=\"uef39e8e8\" data-lake-id=\"ud3be2c4c\" id=\"ud3be2c4c\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u10d5aad4\" id=\"u10d5aad4\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">批准或拒绝</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u362c4dd8\" id=\"u362c4dd8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">：在关键步骤之前暂停图形，例如 API 调用，以审查和批准该操作。如果拒绝该操作，您可以阻止图形执行该步骤，并可能采取替代行动。此模式通常涉及根据人类的输入**路由**图形。</span></li><li fid=\"uef39e8e8\" data-lake-id=\"u93dd854a\" id=\"u93dd854a\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ub8749500\" id=\"ub8749500\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">编辑图形状态</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u07f33b12\" id=\"u07f33b12\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">：暂停图形以审查和编辑图形状态。这对于纠正错误或使用额外信息更新状态非常有用。此模式通常涉及使用人类的输入**更新**状态。</span></li><li fid=\"uef39e8e8\" data-lake-id=\"u3c8e4fe2\" id=\"u3c8e4fe2\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u92b58556\" id=\"u92b58556\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">获取输入</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"ue8dfccba\" id=\"ue8dfccba\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">：在图形的特定步骤明确请求人类输入。这对于收集额外信息或上下文以帮助代理的决策过程或支持**多轮对话**非常有用。</span></li></ol><p data-lake-id=\"ud83b24fc\" id=\"ud83b24fc\"><span data-lake-id=\"u9f71e99a\" id=\"u9f71e99a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">下面我们展示可以使用这些**行动**实现的不同设计模式。</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"_5\" id=\"_5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u606c4b6c\" id=\"u606c4b6c\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">批准或拒绝</span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/concepts/human_in_the_loop/#_5\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u5c65c97d\" id=\"u5c65c97d\"><span data-lake-id=\"ue940180a\" id=\"ue940180a\" style=\"color: var(--md-default-fg-color--lighter)\">​</span></a></h3><p data-lake-id=\"uc735005c\" id=\"uc735005c\" style=\"text-align: center\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2025%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1741599254240-01581f7e-b68a-4e90-9a48-c3b1d85b9790.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22uafbc6fba-8bce-4102-b06a-a7154a7a32b%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22ua13656ea-9a5f-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A1084%2C%22originHeight%22%3A604%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.8000000715255737%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f6f2f2%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22u770b6e79%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"ufb2002b1\" id=\"ufb2002b1\" style=\"text-align: center\"><em><span data-lake-id=\"u0b37cbd2\" id=\"u0b37cbd2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">根据人类的批准或拒绝，图形可以继续执行操作或采取替代路径。</span></em></p><p data-lake-id=\"u9e639eba\" id=\"u9e639eba\"><span data-lake-id=\"u813913c9\" id=\"u813913c9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在关键步骤之前暂停图形，例如 API 调用，以审查和批准该操作。如果拒绝该操作，您可以阻止图形执行该步骤，并可能采取替代行动。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22plain%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22from%20typing%20import%20Literal%5Cnfrom%20langgraph.types%20import%20interrupt%2C%20Command%5Cn%5Cndef%20human_approval(state%3A%20State)%20-%3E%20Command%5BLiteral%5B%5C%22some_node%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22another_node%5C%22%5D%5D%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20is_approved%20%3D%20interrupt(%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7B%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22question%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22%E8%BF%99%E6%98%AF%E6%AD%A3%E7%A1%AE%E7%9A%84%E5%90%97%EF%BC%9F%5C%22%2C%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%23%20%E5%B1%95%E7%A4%BA%E5%BA%94%E7%94%B1%E4%BA%BA%E7%B1%BB%E5%AE%A1%E6%9F%A5%E5%92%8C%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E7%9A%84%E8%BE%93%E5%87%BA%E3%80%82%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%5C%22llm_output%5C%22%3A%20state%5B%5C%22llm_output%5C%22%5D%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%7D%5Cn%20%20%20%20)%5Cn%5Cn%20%20%20%20if%20is_approved%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20Command(goto%3D%5C%22some_node%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20else%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20%20%20%20%20return%20Command(goto%3D%5C%22another_node%5C%22)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E6%B7%BB%E5%8A%A0%E5%88%B0%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%E4%B8%AD%E7%9A%84%E9%80%82%E5%BD%93%E4%BD%8D%E7%BD%AE%E5%B9%B6%E8%BF%9E%E6%8E%A5%E5%88%B0%E7%9B%B8%E5%85%B3%E8%8A%82%E7%82%B9%E3%80%82%5Cngraph_builder.add_node(%5C%22human_approval%5C%22%2C%20human_approval)%5Cngraph%20%3D%20graph_builder.compile(checkpointer%3Dcheckpointer)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%9C%A8%E8%BF%90%E8%A1%8C%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%E5%B9%B6%E8%A7%A6%E5%8F%91%E4%B8%AD%E6%96%AD%E5%90%8E%EF%BC%8C%E5%9B%BE%E5%BD%A2%E5%B0%86%E6%9A%82%E5%81%9C%E3%80%82%5Cn%23%20%E7%94%A8%E6%89%B9%E5%87%86%E6%88%96%E6%8B%92%E7%BB%9D%E6%81%A2%E5%A4%8D%E3%80%82%5Cnthread_config%20%3D%20%7B%5C%22configurable%5C%22%3A%20%7B%5C%22thread_id%5C%22%3A%20%5C%22some_id%5C%22%7D%7D%5Cngraph.invoke(Command(resume%3DTrue)%2C%20config%3Dthread_config)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22sQzFD%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ud0817a8f\" id=\"ud0817a8f\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud28ac96a\" id=\"ud28ac96a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">请参见 </span><a href=\"https://www.aidoczh.com/langgraph/how-tos/human_in_the_loop/review-tool-calls/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u76d5e09f\" id=\"u76d5e09f\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc163d3dd\" id=\"uc163d3dd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgb(30, 136, 229)\">如何审查工具调用</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"uc3592ad2\" id=\"uc3592ad2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> 获取更详细的示例</span></p><h3 data-lake-id=\"VZAv3\" id=\"VZAv3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u55ebb08e\" id=\"u55ebb08e\">添加断点</span></h3><p data-lake-id=\"ubcdd20c6\" id=\"ubcdd20c6\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucc0ca156\" id=\"ucc0ca156\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">在某些节点执行之前或之后设置断点通常很有用。这可以用来在继续之前等待人工批准。当您</span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#compiling-your-graph\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2761c934\" id=\"u2761c934\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0f40cdc3\" id=\"u0f40cdc3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">“编译”图形</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ub2f09b41\" id=\"ub2f09b41\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">时，可以设置这些断点。您可以在节点执行</span><em><span data-lake-id=\"udcaee50f\" id=\"udcaee50f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">之前</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"ud52e6c9a\" id=\"ud52e6c9a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">（使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"u5ded30e8\" id=\"u5ded30e8\"><span data-lake-id=\"ubb938913\" id=\"ubb938913\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt_before</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc6e604e1\" id=\"uc6e604e1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">）或节点执行</span><em><span data-lake-id=\"u4b95f4f5\" id=\"u4b95f4f5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">之后</span></em><span data-lake-id=\"u2c8d88d8\" id=\"u2c8d88d8\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">（使用</span><code data-lake-id=\"uf6a688d7\" id=\"uf6a688d7\"><span data-lake-id=\"u966112b7\" id=\"u966112b7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt_after</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"u102903b2\" id=\"u102903b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">）设置断点。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub2e5fc42\" id=\"ub2e5fc42\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8e04e92c\" id=\"u8e04e92c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">使用断点时，您</span><strong><span data-lake-id=\"ua8828353\" id=\"ua8828353\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">必须</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u9a5fc427\" id=\"u9a5fc427\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">使用</span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#checkpointer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ubd3e7c26\" id=\"ubd3e7c26\"><span data-lake-id=\"u985b1f35\" id=\"u985b1f35\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">检查点</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ubd009f48\" id=\"ubd009f48\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">。这是因为您的图形需要能够恢复执行。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u85116edb\" id=\"u85116edb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u779d8237\" id=\"u779d8237\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">为了恢复执行，您可以使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u7409491b\" id=\"u7409491b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u4853641a\" id=\"u4853641a\"><span data-lake-id=\"u60a690d9\" id=\"u60a690d9\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">None</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"ued1082f7\" id=\"ued1082f7\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"u41cb04bc\" id=\"u41cb04bc\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">作为输入调用您的图。</span></p><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%20Initial%20run%20of%20graph%5Cngraph.invoke(inputs%2C%20config%3Dconfig)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20Let's%20assume%20it%20hit%20a%20breakpoint%20somewhere%2C%20you%20can%20then%20resume%20by%20passing%20in%20None%5Cngraph.invoke(None%2C%20config%3Dconfig)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22lWGzK%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u40ebadff\" id=\"u40ebadff\"><span data-lake-id=\"u8b5b3e0f\" id=\"u8b5b3e0f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">有关如何添加断点的完整演练，请参阅</span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/how-tos/human_in_the_loop/breakpoints/\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"uf73d2b6a\" id=\"uf73d2b6a\"><span data-lake-id=\"ub2f5e904\" id=\"ub2f5e904\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">本指南</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u068411a5\" id=\"u068411a5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u6d4d8d29\" id=\"u6d4d8d29\"><span data-lake-id=\"u68c6dadd\" id=\"u68c6dadd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">人机交互 (HIL) 在</span><span data-lake-id=\"ub781bdbd\" id=\"ub781bdbd\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/agentic_concepts/#human-in-the-loop\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u6d2ac9b3\" id=\"u6d2ac9b3\"><span data-lake-id=\"u35ec6b43\" id=\"u35ec6b43\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">代理系统</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u2e5ce33b\" id=\"u2e5ce33b\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"udca001c0\" id=\"udca001c0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">中至关重要。</span><span data-lake-id=\"ua2c12273\" id=\"ua2c12273\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#breakpoints\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ueb4a7c28\" id=\"ueb4a7c28\"><span data-lake-id=\"u6b61aa30\" id=\"u6b61aa30\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">断点</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ue6568f82\" id=\"ue6568f82\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"ub8e94e91\" id=\"ub8e94e91\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">是一种常见的 HIL 交互模式，允许图在特定步骤停止并寻求人为批准后再继续执行（例如，对于敏感操作）。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"ub71017d2\" id=\"ub71017d2\"><span data-lake-id=\"ucf25a2b2\" id=\"ucf25a2b2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">断点建立在 LangGraph </span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#checkpointer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u1253c493\" id=\"u1253c493\"><span data-lake-id=\"u01f8fca2\" id=\"u01f8fca2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">检查点</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ubf867ce1\" id=\"ubf867ce1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> 之上，检查点在每个节点执行后保存图的状态。 检查点保存在 </span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#threads\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u2194c435\" id=\"u2194c435\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc87ada87\" id=\"uc87ada87\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u44eb69f3\" id=\"u44eb69f3\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> 中，这些线程保存图状态，并且可以在图执行完成后访问。 这使得图执行可以在特定点暂停，等待人为批准，然后从最后一个检查点恢复执行。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"uef3eb2ac\" id=\"uef3eb2ac\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1723887450308-e3f14fcd-4275-49d4-bd99-a82327acd88a.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22u35dde2eb-4568-427c-9844-bb15dbf2777%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22uf583c672-1d10-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22url%22%2C%22width%22%3A692.8297729492188%2C%22height%22%3A502%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22image.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A110017%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A910%2C%22originHeight%22%3A660%2C%22ratio%22%3A1.9499999284744263%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f6f6%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22Gi3ap%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"u62513268\" id=\"u62513268\"><br></p><p data-lake-id=\"u68aa3257\" id=\"u68aa3257\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7654b463\" id=\"u7654b463\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">让我们看看它的基本用法。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u4a5abf74\" id=\"u4a5abf74\"><span data-lake-id=\"uf946125f\" id=\"uf946125f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">下面，我们做两件事</span></p><ol list=\"u3befed3e\"><li fid=\"u7ba7ec2b\" data-lake-id=\"u5eaf9b1c\" id=\"u5eaf9b1c\"><span data-lake-id=\"u4b7eabaf\" id=\"u4b7eabaf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">我们使用</span><span data-lake-id=\"u662bfcf1\" id=\"u662bfcf1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u65aadbdb\" id=\"u65aadbdb\"><span data-lake-id=\"u45cae89d\" id=\"u45cae89d\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: var(--md-code-fg-color)\">interrupt_before</span></code><span data-lake-id=\"uc87bfa9e\" id=\"uc87bfa9e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><span data-lake-id=\"uaf761d1f\" id=\"uaf761d1f\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">指定步骤，来指定</span><span data-lake-id=\"u8a1390d0\" id=\"u8a1390d0\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#breakpoints\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"ub2116c9d\" id=\"ub2116c9d\"><span data-lake-id=\"u0c2da002\" id=\"u0c2da002\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">断点</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u45f0ddea\" id=\"u45f0ddea\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">。</span></li><li fid=\"u7ba7ec2b\" data-lake-id=\"u6cbb7bc5\" id=\"u6cbb7bc5\"><span data-lake-id=\"u64242b3a\" id=\"u64242b3a\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">我们设置一个</span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#checkpointer\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u5d3b7aa6\" id=\"u5d3b7aa6\"><span data-lake-id=\"u7eba35c5\" id=\"u7eba35c5\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">检查点</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"u1818b9b1\" id=\"u1818b9b1\" class=\"lake-fontsize-14\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">来保存图的状态。</span></li></ol><card type=\"inline\" name=\"codeblock\" value=\"data:%7B%22search%22%3A%22%22%2C%22mode%22%3A%22python%22%2C%22code%22%3A%22%23%E7%A4%BA%E4%BE%8B%EF%BC%9Abreakpoints_case.py%5Cnfrom%20typing%20import%20TypedDict%5Cnfrom%20langgraph.graph%20import%20StateGraph%2C%20START%2C%20END%5Cnfrom%20langgraph.checkpoint.memory%20import%20MemorySaver%5Cnfrom%20IPython.display%20import%20Image%2C%20display%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnclass%20State(TypedDict)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20input%3A%20str%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20step_1(state)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22---Step%201---%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20pass%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20step_2(state)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22---Step%202---%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20pass%5Cn%5Cn%5Cndef%20step_3(state)%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20print(%5C%22---Step%203---%5C%22)%5Cn%20%20%20%20pass%5Cn%5Cn%5Cnbuilder%20%3D%20StateGraph(State)%5Cnbuilder.add_node(%5C%22step_1%5C%22%2C%20step_1)%5Cnbuilder.add_node(%5C%22step_2%5C%22%2C%20step_2)%5Cnbuilder.add_node(%5C%22step_3%5C%22%2C%20step_3)%5Cnbuilder.add_edge(START%2C%20%5C%22step_1%5C%22)%5Cnbuilder.add_edge(%5C%22step_1%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22step_2%5C%22)%5Cnbuilder.add_edge(%5C%22step_2%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22step_3%5C%22)%5Cnbuilder.add_edge(%5C%22step_3%5C%22%2C%20END)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20Set%20up%20memory%5Cnmemory%20%3D%20MemorySaver()%5Cn%5Cn%23%20Add%5Cngraph%20%3D%20builder.compile(checkpointer%3Dmemory%2C%20interrupt_before%3D%5B%5C%22step_3%5C%22%5D)%5Cn%5Cn%23%20%E5%B0%86%E7%94%9F%E6%88%90%E7%9A%84%E5%9B%BE%E7%89%87%E4%BF%9D%E5%AD%98%E5%88%B0%E6%96%87%E4%BB%B6%5Cngraph_png%20%3D%20graph.get_graph().draw_mermaid_png()%5Cnwith%20open(%5C%22breakpoints_case.png%5C%22%2C%20%5C%22wb%5C%22)%20as%20f%3A%5Cn%20%20%20%20f.write(graph_png)%22%2C%22autoWrap%22%3Afalse%2C%22lineNumbers%22%3Atrue%2C%22heightLimit%22%3Atrue%2C%22collapsed%22%3Afalse%2C%22hideToolbar%22%3Afalse%2C%22name%22%3A%22%22%2C%22tabSize%22%3Anull%2C%22indentWithTab%22%3Afalse%2C%22lightLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22Github%20Light%22%2C%22customStyle%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22__spacing%22%3A%22both%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22jfv7s%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"u87aafd31\" id=\"u87aafd31\"><card type=\"inline\" name=\"image\" value=\"data:%7B%22src%22%3A%22https%3A%2F%2Fcdn.nlark.com%2Fyuque%2F0%2F2024%2Fpng%2F2424104%2F1723950093083-1f5e87be-5080-45b0-9044-1bfc497cd86e.png%22%2C%22taskId%22%3A%22ufac3e3ce-6815-457d-9100-078f70d57ee%22%2C%22clientId%22%3A%22u4928fb82-0ab6-4%22%2C%22originalType%22%3A%22binary%22%2C%22width%22%3A106.8965482088106%2C%22height%22%3A292%2C%22linkTarget%22%3A%22_blank%22%2C%22name%22%3A%22breakpoints_case.png%22%2C%22size%22%3A10437%2C%22from%22%3A%22paste%22%2C%22originWidth%22%3A155%2C%22originHeight%22%3A424%2C%22ratio%22%3A2.1750001907348633%2C%22status%22%3A%22done%22%2C%22style%22%3A%22none%22%2C%22ocrLocations%22%3A%5B%7B%22text%22%3A%22INTERRUPT%3DBEFORE%22%2C%22x%22%3A26%2C%22y%22%3A309%2C%22width%22%3A112%2C%22height%22%3A12%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP2%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A186%2C%22width%22%3A46%2C%22height%22%3A14%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP3%22%2C%22x%22%3A51%2C%22y%22%3A270%2C%22width%22%3A50%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22STEP%22%2C%22x%22%3A52%2C%22y%22%3A103%2C%22width%22%3A43%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22END%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A392%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%2C%7B%22text%22%3A%22START%22%2C%22x%22%3A60%2C%22y%22%3A19%2C%22width%22%3A32%2C%22height%22%3A13%7D%5D%2C%22showTitle%22%3Afalse%2C%22title%22%3A%22%22%2C%22rotation%22%3A0%2C%22crop%22%3A%5B0%2C0%2C1%2C1%5D%2C%22averageHue%22%3A%22%23f8f8f5%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22DEc8O%22%2C%22margin%22%3A%7B%22top%22%3Atrue%2C%22bottom%22%3Atrue%7D%7D\"></card></p><p data-lake-id=\"uc6f2b8a9\" id=\"uc6f2b8a9\"><span data-lake-id=\"ud2cfae3e\" id=\"ud2cfae3e\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">我们为检查点创建一个 </span><a href=\"https://github.langchain.ac.cn/langgraph/concepts/low_level/#threads\" target=\"_blank\" data-lake-id=\"u86e7ea4e\" id=\"u86e7ea4e\"><span data-lake-id=\"u478614d2\" id=\"u478614d2\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">线程 ID</span></a><span data-lake-id=\"ud63e8adf\" id=\"ud63e8adf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">。</span></p><p data-lake-id=\"u47323cf1\" id=\"u47323cf1\"><span data-lake-id=\"uc86e1d2c\" id=\"uc86e1d2c\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\">我们运行到步骤 3，如</span><span data-lake-id=\"u095246bf\" id=\"u095246bf\" class=\"lake-fontsize-12\" style=\"color: rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.87)\"> </span><code data-lake-id=\"u28781160\" id=\"u28781160\"><span data-lake-id=\"u1e79ed20\" id=\"u1e79ed